WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:01.200
♪ (DRUMS PLAY) ♪

00:00:01.267 --> 00:00:04.070
ANNOUNCER: Introducing
Sarah Silverman.

00:00:04.170 --> 00:00:05.104
(AUDIENCE CHEERS)

00:00:05.171 --> 00:00:07.607
(EXHALES) Sparkle, peanut.

00:00:08.174 --> 00:00:11.244
(AUDIENCE CHEERS)

00:00:11.310 --> 00:00:13.846
♪ (DRUMS CONTINUE) ♪

00:00:13.946 --> 00:00:16.116
I would never buy
a German car.

00:00:16.216 --> 00:00:19.252
Because, you know, we don't
want to give our money to Nazis.

00:00:19.419 --> 00:00:22.521
But, um, I just bought
a German car.

00:00:22.588 --> 00:00:23.923
(LAUGHTER)

00:00:24.857 --> 00:00:28.294
Because I feel like
all the original Nazis are dead.

00:00:28.561 --> 00:00:31.797
There are new Nazis,
but, you know,

00:00:32.164 --> 00:00:33.966
they don't know how
to make a car.

00:00:34.233 --> 00:00:37.704
(LAUGHTER, APPLAUSE)

